Z||000028||84Bill||05-22-2001||11:55 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by grinthock:<BR><B>Again allow me to say;<P>It's over, it's finished... I do apoligize as I have 2 or 3 times, but it's warranted again....  Allow me to list the names of those offended and affected by this apology order.<P>Lisa (The Official Miss Fiero 2001 - Yes it is true!) {Ok JM fuelled my passion a bit can you understand ?}<P>Cliff Pennock (Ok I apoligize for starting a flame war on your box dude, sorry!)<P>84Bill (Sorry dude I got you flamed!)<P>And anyone else who was offended....  Let's all get along.  Note to self -- Don't write on pennocks after a few Brava's it's NOT a good idea.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR> <BR>Its not rally your fault  Grint you would have never done that had I not opend the door to pandoras box. I hope we can come away from this with renewed focus on what we are here for and that is to share our knowledge and the funny things that happen to us and our really cool cars and not our opinions unless asked, and even then be a bit more supportive of our Fiero friends even if they want to "Rice up" their cars with some of those nifty toys. <P>BTW I will apologize as many times as it takes and at every reminder of this nasty event to remove the tarnish of my post.<BR>||||reg||1
