Z||000032||sqoach||05-22-2001||12:12 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by grinthock:<BR><B>Lisa ---<P>   I compliment you, I apoligize, and I even tried to make light, 84bill, myself and everyone saw the end of this and you are continuing.... I on the other hand am not....<P>   It seems brutally obvious to me that you wish to continue this, so, that's fine with me, but not HERE and NOT NOW and not here EVER.  It's going to continue, don't you worry, OFF LIST.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Damn grinthock, what the **** is up your ass?? Look at the post times...stimpy and Lisa both were writing as your post popped up. And I don't really think your apology was very sympathetic. All you're saying is, <I>"it's over, now shut the hell up and quit making grinthock mad!"</I><P>Only reason I'm saying anything is because you're pissing me off with your stupid, immature comments. I don't have anything against you, but please quit!||||reg||1
