Z||000036||Monkeyman||05-22-2001||12:22 PM||||Time for my 2 pennies.  I must have missed all of this hoorah.  Too bad as I needed a laugh.  If Cliff deemed it necessary to close a thread or three, it must have gotten pretty bad.  Cliff seems to be very level headed and very forgiving.  Seems like some of you (I really don't know exactly whom I'm referring to as I haven't read the offending threads) need to give it a rest.  <P>BTW--While Cliff has said that this is <I>our</I> forum, in reality it's his since he foots the bill and does all of the work.  I don't recall anyone (including myself) sending Cliff any money or working side by side with him in his office.  I'd hate to see this forum go down the tubes because of some infantile behavior.  <P>I have spoken.  (for what that's worth)<P>MM||||reg||1
