Z||000040||Cheever2||05-22-2001||12:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 84Bill:<BR><B>HEY DID YOU GUYS SEE AUS's POST on the PFF Sposored race car!!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Ha-ha, nice try!  84Bill, after seeing your posts last night I didn't think I could ever hold a decent conversation with you.  But since then I must say you have handled the situation well.  Your apologies seem sincere, you're not ducking any blame, and you're willing to do what it takes to move on from a mistake.  Pretty good example for me to follow next time I make such a mistake, which I hope I won't do but of course could.  Just wanted to say this before Cliff shuts down this thread also.<P>Grint, there were efforts to send funds to Cliff back when I started here, but he refused to accept.  In the time it took me to write this, he may have already responded, and I would hope he changes his mind and accepts some financial token of appreciation.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000041||grinthock||05-22-2001||12:46 PM|||| <BR>hehe I hope he accepts, because I am the first to admit I use this thing for HOURS a day and if it cost me 9.95 a year to use it I would GLADLY pay (along with EVERYONE else)<P>As for 84bill, give the guy credit he (and I) and trying to divert the noise AWAY from the issues and move on.<p>[This message has been edited by grinthock (edited 05-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000042||Cliff Pennock||05-22-2001||12:55 PM||||Wow, a lot of people here typing messages at the same time.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Grinthock, no need for donations. If ever the need (or greed  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ) arises to raise some funds for the forum, I'll squeeze in a banner here or there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Back on the subject, to clarify myself, I don't expect anyone to apologize for the way they feel about a particular subject. I don't necessarily think some of the reactions were unwarranted, I just think the way those feelings were expressed were perhaps a bit unwarranted.<P>But that's the problem with a medium like the internet. You write something down for everyone to read. So before you realize what it is you've actually just said, the damage has been done.||||reg||1
Z||000043||JSocha||05-22-2001||01:04 PM||||I know I'm only small potatoes here like everyone else (based on membership that is 2K+ members) when it comes to the big picture, yet I would like to make a suggestion or two.  Take it or leave this suggestion as you may or wish as that is your choice.<P>Starting with Lisa (if she approves of this idea) that all involved who may have insulted her and worse yet have hurt her feelings should contact her first by EMAIL and perhaps make a phone call (if at all possible) directly to her and apologize.  You know who you may be.  This way, Lisa has the opportunity to hear and sense the sincerity in their voice that otherwise lacks in this type of communication and feedback from both directions can be obtained which will result in better clarity to the issues will be taken.  From there she can let us all know that this issue is once and for all finally settled.  That goes for whoever including myself if need be.  And if further apologies to other members need to be taken as a result of these threads, perhaps the same should be done there.<P>BTW Lisa, I'm happy to see your at least still with us  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and at least reading these posts.  Glad to see you posted, even if it was in defense which was sad once again to see that you had to do.<P>I am also noticing this is getting ugly in a couple of areas.  Perhaps another suggestion, is just turn off your computer for a day or two and let things rest and get to get ones emotions/frustrations in order to think with a clear and sober head.  <P>I know it is or will be hard as I am addicted to this Forum myself (heck, I'm at work most of the day playin here).  I would just hate to go through withdrawls if Cliff himself gets fed up with this whole situation and shuts this site down.  <P>Cliff has more invested "financially" here then any other people and he has lost as a result of this forum he has "ELECTIVELY" been willing to sponser.  <P>Others have "emotions" as well as their "friendships" invested here to loose.  Neither of them superior to the other but equally equivelant if not important.<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000044||grinthock||05-22-2001||01:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B><BR>But that's the problem with a medium like the internet. You write something down for everyone to read. So before you realize what it is you've actually just said, the damage has been done.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>So true .....||||reg||1
Z||000045||FieroLisa||05-22-2001||01:31 PM||||I have recieved many encouraging emails and IMs and I want to say THANKS to my fiero FRIENDS... <P>This started over one misconcieved statement, and its escalated beyond belied. Cliff, I'm sorry to take up so much space on the forum, I never meant to make such a fuss...but I did get a good laugh at "All your post are belong to us"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I knew I talked a lot before, but geesh!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||1
