Z||000057||stimpy||05-22-2001||05:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Voytek:<BR><B><BR>STIMPY: you NEVER seize to pi*s me off.  Why do you have to drag that 'you Canadians / us Americans' thing into every disagreement???!!  Grinthok is another member on the Forum.  If I don't like YOUR opinion, I won't call you a '(insert word)' American, I'll just call you a dumb sh*t!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I'll just try to explain it one time for you. If pictures are necessary, I can't help you there. The Canadian thing is whats called a "running gag". Although it seems that most folks that get realy twisted over what I say do have "Canada" in the profile and the first person who really uncorked on me was from Canada, I am BY NO MEANS a Canadian hater! I'm an equal opportunity smartass, and will call em as I see em no matter where you are from. <BR>That being said, I have always gotten along with every Canadian person I've ever met. Usually they DO have a sense of humor, and aren't usually so intensely patriotic. Kudos to you, Voytek. You are an inspiration to all slacker Canadians to be better, prouder, drunker Canucks. God save the Maple Leaf! eh.<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
